#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.spectacle.appdata.xml:6
msgid "Spectacle"
msgstr "Spectacle"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.spectacle.appdata.xml:8
msgid ""
"Spectacle is a simple application for capturing desktop screenshots. It can "
"capture images of the entire desktop, a single monitor, the currently active "
"window, the window currently under the mouse, or a rectangular region of the "
"screen. The images can then be printed, sent to other applications for "
"manipulation, or quickly be saved as-is."
msgstr ""
"Spectacle ye una aplicación pa facer captures de pantalla. Pue capturar "
"imáxenes de tol escritoriu, un monitor, la ventana activa, la ventana "
"qu'anguaño tea sol mur o una rexón rectanglar de la pantalla. Les imáxenes "
"puen imprentase, unviase a otres aplicaciones pa manipulación o guardase "
"aína como se faigan."

